# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT GAME CONTENT OR CODE DERIVED FROM IT
# Game data is supplied by each user from their own copy. Code generated from a
# game executable is derived from the publisher's code and stays on the machine
# that produced it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GameData/*
!GameData/README.md

# Xbox 360 and PC game files, disc images, title updates
*.xex
*.xexp
*.iso
*.god
*.xcp
*.stfs
*.BNDL
*.bndl
*.VP6
*.vp6
*.SPS
*.sps
*.SWC0
*.swc0
*.exe
*.dll

# Recompiler output and private inputs (any depth)
generated/
**/generated/
private/
**/private/
assets/
game_root/
*.ppc.cpp
ppc_*.cpp
ppc_*.h

# Analysis of a local game installation (contains hashes and strings of game binaries)
GameIntegration/ExecutableAnalysis/*.json
*_strings.txt

# Local research notes: they contain local paths and details of a private game copy.
# Kept on this PC only. Public documentation lives in the files allowed below.
Documentation/*
!Documentation/BUILD_GUIDE.md
!Documentation/PUBLIC_STATUS.md

# Signing material and secrets
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
*.key
*.pem
.env

# Build output
build/
out/
dist/
DerivedData/
App/*.xcodeproj/
App/Generated/
*.ipa
*.xcarchive

# Tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.vs/
.vscode/
